    affiliation: "Purdue University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8308-5016"
abstract: >-
  A JuMP and QUBODrivers interface for the McMahon Lab cim-optimizer Coherent
  Ising Machine simulator.
repository-code: "https://github.com/JuliaQUBO/CIMOptimizer.jl"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: 2026-06-27
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.8021079"
keywords:
  - Julia
  - Coherent Ising Machine
  - quadratic unconstrained binary optimization
  - Ising model
  - QUBO
